{"ID":"20240727164422-zgnnfe2","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240727164422-zgnnfe2","title":"破铜钱（天胡荽）","type":"doc","updated":"20240902135502"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240727165139-yjbdokw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727165139-yjbdokw","updated":"20240727165141"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 611px;","style":"width: 601px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"天胡荽 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/天胡荽 4-20240727165141-5s3ab4r.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 601px;\" parent-style=\"width: 611px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 541px;","style":"width: 531px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"天胡荽 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/天胡荽 3-20240727164713-mig1wht.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 531px;\" parent-style=\"width: 541px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240727164601-1ko79iy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727164601-1ko79iy","updated":"20240727164618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 391px;","style":"width: 381px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"天胡荽 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/天胡荽 1-20240727164601-x75l8x7.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 381px;\" parent-style=\"width: 391px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 686px;","style":"width: 676px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"天胡荽 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/天胡荽 2-20240727164618-bepk76n.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 676px;\" parent-style=\"width: 686px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240727165245-xsa8ozo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727165245-xsa8ozo","updated":"20240727165303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 501px;","style":"width: 491px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"天胡荽 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/天胡荽 5-20240727165245-oxeht5z.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 491px;\" parent-style=\"width: 501px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 671px;","style":"width: 661px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"天胡荽 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/天胡荽 6-20240727165303-mdl64e9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 661px;\" parent-style=\"width: 671px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240727170927-ya8tt0o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727170927-ya8tt0o","updated":"20240727170927"}},{"ID":"20240727170927-ix6i0x1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727170927-ix6i0x1","updated":"20240727170927"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"易混淆品种（连钱草、铜钱草、金钱草、破铜钱、积雪草）"}]},{"ID":"20240727170927-0z3xugb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727170927-0z3xugb","updated":"20240727170927"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240727153805-5gddcod.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240727171028-6yh63yz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727171028-6yh63yz","updated":"20240727171217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"点我跳转→"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240727165400-e6mtczx","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"连钱草（活血丹、透骨消、金钱艾、十八缺）"}]},{"ID":"20240727171028-ebqijgd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727171028-ebqijgd","updated":"20240727171224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"点我跳转→"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240727163626-r6qt16y","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"铜钱草（香菇草、水金钱）"}]},{"ID":"20240727171028-76rus1n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727171028-76rus1n","updated":"20240727172041"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"点我跳转→"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240205153748-igsdarp","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"金钱草"}]},{"ID":"20240727171028-08agb7t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727171028-08agb7t","updated":"20240727172046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"点我跳转→"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240504170621-38fj7z1","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"198积雪草（雷公根）"}]},{"ID":"20240727164720-q9osfac","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240727164720-q9osfac"}},{"ID":"20240902135454-l68oyxf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-l68oyxf","updated":"20240902135502"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：天胡荽"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-z58dn9w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-z58dn9w","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"天胡荽《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-j9lhfna","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-j9lhfna","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】TiānHúSuī"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-ff0xmuz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-ff0xmuz","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】金钱草[江西]、满天星[四川]、破铜钱、明镜草、铺地锦[广东、湖南]、盆上芫茜、星秀草"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-82nzclc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-82nzclc","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为伞形科植物天胡荽HydrocotylesibthorpioidesLam.[H.rotundifoliaRoxb.]，以全草入药。全年可采，鲜用或秋季采收晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-hfre0wm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-hfre0wm","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘、淡、微辛，凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-irbhply","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-irbhply","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】祛风清热，化痰止咳。用于黄疸型传染性肝炎，肝硬化腹水，胆石症，泌尿系感染，泌尿系结石，伤风感冒，咳嗽，百日咳，咽喉炎，扁桃体炎，目翳；外用治湿疹，带状疱疹，衄血。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-llfftc9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-llfftc9","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】3～5钱；外用适量，鲜品捣烂敷患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-v67if0y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-v67if0y","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【备注】（1）本品具有祛风清热作用，对于风火赤眼，可配桑叶、菊花、点地梅等药同用；对于咽喉肿痛，可配土牛膝、白毛夏枯草等同用；治疗蛇缠疮，可用新鲜全草捣烂，用酒精浸半天后，用棉花球蘸搽患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-n0lfgbj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-n0lfgbj","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-19paw6t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-19paw6t","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"天胡荽《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-ho304wk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-ho304wk","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《千金·食治》"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-evu049q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-evu049q","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】TiānHúSuī"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-4g1chna","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-4g1chna","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】鸡肠菜（《千金·食治》），滴滴金（《生草药性备要》），翳草（《医林纂要》），铺地锦（《潮州府志》），肺风草（《质问本草》），破铜钱（《植物名实图考》），满天星（《草木便方》），明镜草（《分类草药性》），翳子草、盘上芫茜（《岭南采药录》），细叶钱苗口（《广州植物志》），落地金钱（《贵州民间方药集》），过路蜈蚣草、鱼察子草（《福建民间草药》），花边灯盏（《广西中兽医药植》），天星草、猫爪草（《南宁市药物志》），地星宿（《贵阳民间药草》），伤寒草、鼠迹草（《广西中药志》），盆荽（《生草药实用"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-uqvretw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-uqvretw","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为伞形科植物天胡荽的全草，洗净，阴干或鲜用。夏秋间采收全草，洗净，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-tigdr0t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-tigdr0t","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】多年生草本。茎纤弱细长，匍匐，平铺地上成片，秃净或近秃净；茎节上生根。单叶互生，圆形或近肾形，直径0.5～1.6厘米，基部心形，5～7浅裂，裂片短，有2～3个钝齿，上面深绿色，光滑，下面绿色或有柔毛，或两面均自光滑以至微有柔毛；叶柄纤弱，长0.5～9厘米。伞形花序与叶对生，单生于节上；伞梗长0.5～3厘米；总苞片4～10枚，倒披针。形，长约2毫米；每伞形花序具花10～15朵，花无柄或有柄；萼齿缺乏；花瓣卵形，呈镊合状排列；绿白色。双悬果略呈心脏形，长1～1.25毫米，宽1.5～2毫米；分果侧面扁平，光滑或有斑点，背棱略锐。花期4～5月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-xwdep70","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-xwdep70","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】生于路旁草地较湿润之处。分布辽宁、河南、江苏、浙江、安徽、湖南、江西、四川、湖北、福建、台湾、广东、广西、云南、贵州等地。产江苏、浙江、四川、广东、广西、湖南、福建、江西等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-p2b3xgp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-p2b3xgp","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】干燥全草，根呈细圆柱形，外表淡黄或灰黄色。茎细长弯曲，黄绿色，节处残留细根或根痕。叶多皱缩或破碎，圆形或近肾形，掌状5～7浅裂或裂至叶片中部，淡绿色，具扭状叶柄。有香气。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-xwydh7w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-xwydh7w","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】含黄酮甙、酚类、氨基酸、挥发油、香豆素。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-diligzr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-diligzr","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-mv8wien","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-mv8wien","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦辛，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-3xysu8o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-3xysu8o","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《生草药性备要》：\"苦，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-zcdnnb4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-zcdnnb4","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《医林纂要》：\"辛，平。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-vbcnz33","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-vbcnz33","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《南宁市药物志》：\"辛，平，有小毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-dvvc7ia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-dvvc7ia","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-vlxzic0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-vlxzic0","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"清热，利尿，消肿，解毒。治黄疸，赤白痢疾，淋病，小便不利，目翳，喉肿，痈疽疔疮，跌打瘀肿。用于急性黄疸型肝炎、急性肾炎、百日咳、尿路结石、脚癣、带状疱疹、结膜炎、丹毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-i722hbw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-i722hbw","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《千金·食治》：\"疗痔。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-u9sa7se","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-u9sa7se","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《生草药性备要》：\"治癞，臭耳，鼻上头风，痘眼去膜，消肿，敷跌打大疮。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-myljp58","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-myljp58","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《草木便方》：\"治头疮，白秃，风瘙，疥癞。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-hdt2eq5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-hdt2eq5","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《贵州民间方药集》：\"解热利尿。治肾脏炎、黄疸。外用揉擦伤肿，塞鼻可消眼炎，取汁滴耳中治中耳炎。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-0s9qg78","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-0s9qg78","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《民间常用草药汇编》：\"治钩虫病。外用捣涂酒渣鼻。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-avcih6w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-avcih6w","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《南宁市药物志》：\"治瘰疬毒疮，无名肿毒，跌打筋伤，哮喘。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-4d0riae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-4d0riae","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《本草推陈》：\"治急性扁桃腺炎及咽喉炎，疥癣，蛇咬伤，痈疽，漆疮，风湿痛，挫伤等。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-gb6lh7f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-gb6lh7f","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，3～5钱；或捣汁。外用：捣敷、塞鼻或捣汁滴耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-1wxudmp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-1wxudmp","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-90y9xy6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-90y9xy6","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治肝炎发黄：鲜地星宿五钱至八钱（干的三至五钱），茵陈蒿五钱。煎水吃，日服三次。（《贵阳民间药草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-uoqmshb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-uoqmshb","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治急性黄疸型肝炎：鲜天胡荽一至二两，白糖一两，酒水各半煎服，每日一剂。（《江西草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-q5ycnr6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-q5ycnr6","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治阳黄黄疸及小儿风热：天胡荽捣烂，加盐少许，开水冲服。（《广西中药志》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-dlo8hd3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-dlo8hd3","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治小儿夏季热：鲜天胡荽适量，捣汁半小碗，每服三至五匙，每日服五、六次。（《江西草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-yngx3b2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-yngx3b2","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治痢疾：满天星，蛇疙瘩，刺梨根，石榴皮。煎服。（《四川中药志》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-vz2j3d5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-vz2j3d5","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治红淋症：地星宿、萹蓄各四两。捣烂取汁兑白糖服。（《贵阳民间药草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-11l4sfl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-11l4sfl","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治肾结石：天胡荽一至二两，水煎服。（《江西民间草药验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-za5bk7u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-za5bk7u","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治小便不通：鲜地星宿一两，捣烂挤水，加白糖一两服，或煎水兑白糖服。（《贵阳民间药草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-v1wi48b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-v1wi48b","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治小儿疳积：地星宿五钱至一两，蒸鸡肝或猪肝吃。（《贵阳民间药萆》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-mdwuhn6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-mdwuhn6","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩明目、去翳：翳草揉塞鼻中，左翳塞右孔，右翳塞左孔。（《医林纂要》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-9hrcd15","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-9hrcd15","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治风火眼痛：天胡荽、旱莲草各等分。捣烂敷。（《广西中药志》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-d31ks6o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-d31ks6o","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿治跌打瘀肿：天胡荽捣烂，酒炒热，敷撩患处。（《广西中药志》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-o3xlqcf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-o3xlqcf","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀治荨麻疹：天胡荽一至二两，捣汁以开水冲服。（《福建中草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-ofcw7vc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-ofcw7vc","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒁治发癍及疔，热极，色紫黑者：天胡荽六至七钱，放碗内捣烂，不使水走散，再加洗米水煎沸冲入，去渣饮之，将渣敷发癍及发疔处，热从小便出。（《岭南采药录》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-04h0816","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-04h0816","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒂治缠腰蛇（带状疱疹）：鲜天胡荽一握，捣烂绞汁一杯，加雄黄末一钱，涂患处，日二次。（《福建民间草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-y0w1tul","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-y0w1tul","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒃治喉炎：天胡荽-至二两，煎水或捣汁加食盐少许含漱。（《福建中草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-759uhpp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-759uhpp","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒄治齿缝出血：鲜天胡荽一握，用冷开水洗净，捣烂浸醋，含在口中；五分钟吐出，日含三至四次。（《福建民间草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-tpek728","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-tpek728","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒅治头疮白秃：满天星，牛耳大黄，木槿皮。捣涂。（《四川中药志》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-z9dq1tj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-z9dq1tj","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒆治耳烂：满天星鲜草揉汁涂。（《四川中药志》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-sv4nlcv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-sv4nlcv","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒇治百日咳：天胡荽五钱，捣烂和蜜糖开水冲服。（《湖南药物志》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-xe8vt8r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-xe8vt8r","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】急性黄疸型肝炎：试用于急性黄疸型肝炎数十例，服药3～5剂即退黄。服法：新鲜天胡荽（满天星）1～2两，加水及糯米酒各半炖服。每剂炖2次，上、下午空腹各服1次。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-b8a9u3s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-b8a9u3s","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【备注】"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-6d0w6o6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-6d0w6o6","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品在江西亦作金钱草入药，参见\"江西金钱草\"条。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-caecu22","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-caecu22","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在四川地区，毛叶天胡荽与本种同样使用。其叶片较大，直径可达2.5厘米，深裂，疏被长柔毛或较多。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-9bc0d3z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-9bc0d3z","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-ad6ecm9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-ad6ecm9","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"天胡荽《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-ahmygfr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-ahmygfr","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】出自《千金·食治》"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-u57v6rr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-u57v6rr","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】TiānHúSuī"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-jr6ge05","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-jr6ge05","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】LawnPennywortHerb,HerbofLawnPennywort"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-qwm7y73","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-qwm7y73","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】鸡肠菜、破钱草、千里光、千光草、滴滴金、翳草、铺地锦、肺风草、破铜钱、满天星、明镜草、翳子草、盘上芫茜、落地金钱、过路蜈蚣草、花边灯盏、地星宿、鼠迹草、慝虫草、镜面草、扁地青、四片孔、盆上芫荽、星秀草、落地梅花、扁地金、小叶金钱草、小叶破铜钱、克麻藤、遍地锦、蔡达草、地钱草、野芹菜、小金钱"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-0rcjno2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-0rcjno2","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-fgztzqn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-fgztzqn","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为伞形科植物天胡荽和破铜钱的全草。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-jtmabe3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-jtmabe3","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：1.HydrocotylesibthorpioidesLam.[H.rotudifoliaRoxb.]2.HydrocotylesibthorpioidesLam.Var.batrachium(Hance)Hand.-Mazz.exShan"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-0ysr5yz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-0ysr5yz","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：夏秋间采收全草，洗净，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-2k3c8js","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-2k3c8js","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】多年生草本。有特异气味。茎细长而匍事，平铺地上成片。节上生根。叶互生；叶片质薄，圆肾形或近圆形，长0.5-1.5cm，宽0.8-2.5cm，基部心形，不分裂或3-7裂，裂片阔卵形，边缘有钝齿，表面无毛，背面及叶柄顶端疏被白柔毛；托叶略呈半圆形，全缘栽稍有浅裂。伞形花序与叶对生，单生于节上；花序梗纤细，长0.5-3cm；小总苞片卵形至卵状披针形，有黄色透明腺点，小形花序有花5-18；花瓣卵形，绿白色，有腺点。雄蕊5，子房下位。双悬果略呈心形，长1-1.4mm，宽1.2-2mm，两而扁压，中棱在果熟时极为隆起，成熟时有紫色斑点。花、果期4-9月。本种与天胡荽的区别在于：叶片较小，3-5深裂几达基部，侧面裂片间有一侧或两侧仅裂达基部1/3处，裂片均呈楔形。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-cacnu69","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-cacnu69","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-ymclkrg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-ymclkrg","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：生于湿润的路旁、草地、沟边及林下。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-cym55iy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-cym55iy","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于西南及陕西、江苏、安徽、浙江、江西、福建、台湾、湖南、湖北、广东、广西等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-bvl58mt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-bvl58mt","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-ki9djjq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-ki9djjq","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别（1）天胡荽多皱缩成团，根细，表面淡黄色或灰黄色。茎极纤细，弯曲，黄绿以，节处有根痕及残留细根。叶多皱缩破碎，完整中圆形或近肾形，5-7浅裂，少不分裂，边缘有钝齿；托叶膜质；叶柄长约0.5cm，扭曲状。伞形花序小。双悬果略呈心形，两侧压扁。气香。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-19q28zy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-19q28zy","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）破铜钱呈破缩成团。茎纤细。叶多破碎；完整叶展平后近圆形，叶片3-5深裂几达基部，侧裂片间有一侧或两侧仅裂达基部1/3处，裂片楔形。气微香，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-2yxzoq5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-2yxzoq5","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别天胡荽茎横切面：表皮细胞1列，皮层细胞具细小密集的演粉粒；具分泌道，内径20-45μm。中柱有7个维管束排列成环。贿细胞亦含细小的椭圆形淀粉粒。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-zlow2bf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-zlow2bf","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"天胡荽叶横切面：上焉有皮细胞垂周壁均呈不规则弯曲；上表皮偶有非腺毛；表皮有长角状或长锥形大型多细朐非腺毛，稀疏，一般见于叶脉上。上下表皮均有气孔。栅栏组织通过主脉。主脉维管事及侧脉维管束下方有分泌道。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-s4n3ztt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-s4n3ztt","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粉末特征：天胡荽呈淡棕绿以。微具腥气，味淡微辛。①非腺毛呈短角状或长角状锥形，长可达600余μm，由10多个至数十个细胞组成，排成多列；亦可见由2-4个细胞组成，排成单列的小非腺毛。②上表皮细胞垂周壁弯曲，直径27-58μm。③下表皮细胞壁亦弯曲，直径27-67μm。④上下表皮均有气孔，直径14-20μm，长18-24μm，不定式、平轴式或直轴式，副卫细胞2-3个。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-7ehcypj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-7ehcypj","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】全草含黄酮类成分：槲皮素（quercetin)，槲皮素-3-半乳糖甙（quercetin-3-galactoside)，异鼠李素（isorham-netin)，槲皮素-3-O-β-D-（6-咖啡酰半乳糖甙）[quercetin-3-O-β（6-caffeoygalactoside)[1]。又含木质体成分，左旋芝麻素（sesamin)[2]和鼠体成分：豆甾醇（stigmasterol)[3]。不含香豆精（coutnarin)[4。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-hm54cf2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-hm54cf2","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】抗病原微生物作用天胡荽1：1水煎剂，体外试验对金黄色葡萄球菌有较强抑制作用，对变形杆菌，福氏痢疾杆菌、伤寒杆菌也有不程度的抑制作用[1]。鼠疫模型试验结果，鼠模抑制为54%，用天胡荽全草100g/kg时行抗疟筛选结果，抑制率为54%[1，2]。口服香豆粗250mg/kg，对正常糖尿病大鼠有显着降血糖作用[3]。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-q5k7drt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-q5k7drt","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】味辛；微苦；性凉"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-1n107ji","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-1n107ji","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】清热利湿；角毒消肿。主黄疸；痢疾；水肿；淋症；目翳；喉肿；痈肿疮毒；带状疱疹；跌打损伤"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-9v30a51","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-9v30a51","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，9-15g，鲜品30-60g；或捣汁。外用：适量，捣烂敷；或捣取汁涂。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-nnvq5cm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-nnvq5cm","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-kak827e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-kak827e","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《千金·食治》：疗痔。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-mdvfens","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-mdvfens","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《生草药性备要》：治癞，臭耳，鼻上头风，痘眼去膜，消肿，敷跌打大疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-29gzdln","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-29gzdln","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《草木便方》：治头疮，白秃，风瘙，疥癞。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-y7bfbq6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-y7bfbq6","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《贵州民间方药集》：解热利尿。治肾脏炎、黄疸。外用揉擦伤肿，塞鼻可消眼炎，取汁滴耳中治中耳炎。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-pnivtz7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-pnivtz7","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《民间常用草药汇编》：治钩虫病。外用捣涂酒渣鼻。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-y82v74h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-y82v74h","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《南宁市药物志》：治瘰疬毒疮，无名肿毒，跌打筋伤，哮喘。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-6fwc9pu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-6fwc9pu","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《本草推陈》：治急性扁桃腺炎及咽喉炎，疥癣，蛇咬伤，痈疽，漆疮，风湿痛，挫伤等。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135454-hd3tdh1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135454-hd3tdh1","updated":"20240902135518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902135455-czr0dis","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902135455-czr0dis","updated":"20240902135518"}},{"ID":"20240902135456-ezm5960","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135456-ezm5960","updated":"20240902135518"}}]}